{"id":"n08d5a6c8c8","headline":"Katayama says Takaichi wasn’t emphasizing weak yen merit","summary":"Finance Minister Katayama said Takaichi's comments were not meant to highlight the benefits of a weak yen. Her remarks appeared to keep alive speculation over possible government intervention in currency markets.","why":"Japanese authorities can intervene in currency markets to slow yen moves, which affects dollar-yen trades and exporters' earnings. Official comments on the yen are closely watched by FX investors.","category":"markets","event_type":"other","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Tokyo","country":"Japan","lat":35.676,"lon":139.65,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Japan Times","url":"https://www.japantimes.co.jp/business/2026/02/03/economy/japan-finance-minister-yen/"},"sources":[{"name":"The Japan Times","url":"https://www.japantimes.co.jp/business/2026/02/03/economy/japan-finance-minister-yen/"}],"published_at":"2026-02-03T02:05:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T20:10:53Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"1c9208a091090323","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T20:10:53Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-02-03T02:05:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-02-03T06:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"JA","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/central-bank-building-5855081.jpg","alt":"central bank building (illustration)","credit":"Leolo212","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/river-forest-foggy-forest-5855081/"}}